---
title: Lemon Tart
portions: 8
category: Pastry
---

@use "./bases/pate-sucree.gram" as &pate

## Shell

[Line] Roll out the &pate{250 g} and line a #tart ring{}. Dock with a #fork{}.

[Blind bake] Bake at ^{170°C} for ~_{15 min} until lightly golden.

## Curd ->&curd

[Whisk] Whisk the @egg{3}, the @sugar{150 g}, the @lemon juice{120 ml}<@lemon{4}(juiced) and the @lemon zest{2}<@lemon{2}(zested) in a #saucepan{}. ->&curd mix{}

[Thicken] Cook the &curd mix over ^{low heat} for ~{5 min}, stirring, until it coats the #spatula{}. Add the @butter{60 g} off heat.

[Strain] Pass through a #fine sieve{}.

## Assembly

[Fill] Pour the &curd into the shell. Set for ~_refrigerator{3 h}.
